{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901100930010","name":"にちか","text":"これ……シャープナー、ですよね？\r\n包丁研ぐやつ……","trans":"这个……是磨刀器，对吧？\n用来磨菜刀的那种……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ\r\nそれあると便利って聞いたからさ","trans":"嗯\n听说有这个会很方便","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901100930020","name":"にちか","text":"……台所借ります","trans":"……借用一下厨房","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901100930030","name":"にちか","text":"試しでちょっと使ってみますねー","trans":"我先试用一下哦—","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……そうだな\r\n構わないぞ","trans":"……是啊\n没问题","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}